        "text_qmTJTF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>See clearly underwater with nearsighted prescription snorkel dive masks designed for people with myopia and everyday vision correction needs. Our snorkel mask for nearsighted divers features optical-grade tempered glass, comfortable silicone skirts, and minus degree lenses in 0.50 increments for a more precise fit. Whether you need a reliable nearsighted swim mask for travel, swim adventures, or scuba diving, these masks offer great comfort, clarity, and long-lasting performance underwater.</p>"
